      "docs": "Includes the React component, animation hooks, engine, 12 bundled pixel-art skins, and skin credits. Customize paused, followCursor, sleepEnabled, bubblePlacement, and bubbleScale without remounting. Mark elements with data-oneko-zone=\"avoid\" or data-oneko-zone=\"attract\", or pass zones using selectors or viewport rectangles. Render from a client-only entry point. Optional: copy sound files to public/cat-sounds/, set soundBasePath to your sound directory, or set meow={false}. Use storageKey for independent saved positions."
